      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We need something like this, with the current system that doesn't tell you what's showing and what's not it's a nightmare to choose which avatars to hide when your frames go to hell. At the moment, distinguishing between an optimized avatar with complex animations and an aberration with 50 materials on the main avatar is impossible.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
