      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think we just need to have 2 ratings: current one and overall one. So you can see that currently some avatar is \"good\" but overall its \"very poor\" because of these additional elements that are not visible by default unless you activate some animation. That would be a huge improvement when trying to find these actually lagging people and not just people with more advanced avatars, to hide the right one.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
